  "commentary": [
    {
      "t": 0,
      "text": "A few minutes left at the Azteca, and Brazil are happy to keep the ball."
    },
    {
      "t": 1.5,
      "text": "Clodoaldo, deep in the Brazil half, going past one, two, three of them!"
    },
    {
      "t": 5.5,
      "text": "Rivellino has it now, and plays it long down the left."
    },
    {
      "t": 9,
      "text": "Jairzinho, drifting in off the touchline, Facchetti tracking the run…"
    },
    {
      "t": 12.5,
      "text": "Pelé, on the edge of the area, in no hurry at all…"
    },
    {
      "t": 15.75,
      "text": "Pelé pushes it out to the right — and here comes the captain!"
    },
    {
      "t": 16.6,
      "text": "Carlos Alberto!"
    },
    {
      "t": 17.4,
      "text": "WHAT A GOAL! Four–one! Brazil have kept the very best until last!"
    },
    {
      "t": 18.8,
      "text": "Pass after pass after pass, and the captain finishes it. Glorious."
    }
  ],
